------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Cohort
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The four-site retrospective cohort, the calibration split and the external
profile table used by the manuscript are held at their contributing
institutions under a data-use agreement and are not redistributed. What this
release ships is the cohort schema and a schema-compatible cohort fixture built
from the manuscript's reported marginals. No real patient record is present in
this tree.
